## 8. Logging Standards

### Log Levels

```python
# DEBUG - Detailed debugging info (state values, intermediate results)
logger.debug(f"Processing item: {item}")

# INFO - Normal operations (start/end of operations, key events)
logger.info(f"Processing lead {lead_id}")
logger.info(f"Order placed: {order_id}")

# WARNING - Unexpected but handled situations
logger.warning(f"Missing optional field: {field}")

# ERROR - Failures that need attention
logger.error(f"Error placing order for {lead_id}: {e}")
```

### Email Logging (MANDATORY)

```python
from ..utils.state_logger import log_incoming_email, log_outgoing_email

# Log incoming emails
log_incoming_email(email_from, email_subject, email_body)

# Log outgoing emails
log_outgoing_email(email_to, email_subject, email_body)
```

