## Checklist for Code Review

Before submitting any code, verify:

- [ ] Module has docstring
- [ ] Logger declared with full module path
- [ ] Imports organized correctly
- [ ] All functions have type hints
- [ ] All public functions have docstrings
- [ ] State accessed with `.get()` and defaults
- [ ] `log_state_before()` and `log_state_after()` in nodes
- [ ] `get_tracing_context()` wrapping main logic
- [ ] Exceptions caught and handled appropriately
- [ ] No hardcoded values - using settings/constants
- [ ] Using enums for status/intent values
- [ ] No state mutation - only returning new values
